<title>USA: New York Bagel closes Lots A' Bagels buy.</title>
<headline>New York Bagel closes Lots A' Bagels buy.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA, Kan. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York Bagel Enterprises Inc said Monday it completed its acquisition of Lots A' Bagels Inc in a deal valued at $2.7 million.</p>
<p>The transaction will give New York Bagel a strong presence in the Colorado Springs, Colo., area, said the company. The assets included seven leased restaurants and a bagel commissary in Colorado Springs, and Monument, Colo.</p>
<p>New York Bagel, which operates and franchises bagel restaurants, now has 32 company-owned units.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
